Enable exact interior GDN checkpoint export on CUDA Triton/FLA in align mode.
Use upstream 0.32 checkpoint metadata and its host offsets; never reintroduce
the 0.31 metadata plumbing. Preserve the default-off behavior and reject
unsupported backends before allocation. Save exact convolution history and
recompute normalized recurrent prefixes through the existing FLA kernel.
Exclude unreserved null destinations and cross-group metadata reuse.
Prefix recomputation and metadata readback add work; no speed gain claimed.

Kind: feature
What: opt-in exact interior GDN checkpoint export using upstream 0.32 metadata
Upstream: follow-up to HyperQwen PR #392
Cut-against: 0.32.0
Retires-when: upstream GDN exports exact interior recurrent and convolution states

